Sac fests are not something you typically do very early in the game.
An early altar can be used if any monster happens to pass by, but it's
more useful to make a note of it being there so you can use it later
on, once you obtain ?oCM and /oCM or even +oCM (since monsters
generated on DL 1 when you are a high XL will be easy to beat).

Note that the first two are plentiful in Gehennom, although if you get
that far, you don't really need to be asking questions like this :)

It's also worthwhile to note which corpses are heavier than others.
Generally this is pretty obvious, but it's often a good idea to plan
things out carefully (especially if you are going to use one of the CM
methods that creates several monsters at once).

